  "goodToKnow": "Die Dosis (plural Dosen) is a dose: die richtige Dosis, eine tödliche Dosis, Die Dosis macht das Gift (the dose makes the poison, often attributed to Paracelsus). The plural Dosen looks like the plural of die Dose (can, tin), so context matters. The verb is dosieren (to measure out) and die Überdosis is an overdose. It's also used figuratively: eine Dosis Ironie."
